{#-
  Tell the current address that somebody asked to move the account to
  another. Sent with the confirmation to the new address, so a change
  the account holder did not ask for is seen where they already read.
  Context:
    new_email  the address the change was asked for
    name       who to greet: their full name, or their username where
               the account has none
    username   the account's username
    email      the current address this is sent to, said back to them
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}A change to your Quill email address was asked for{% endblock subject %}
{% block preheader %}Nothing changes unless the new address confirms it.{% endblock preheader %}
{% block body %}
{{ c.heading("Your email *change*") }}
{{ c.paragraph("Hi " ~ name ~ ",") }}
{% call c.paragraph() %}Somebody signed in as <strong>{{ username }}</strong> asked to move this Quill account to <strong>{{ new_email }}</strong>. Nothing changes unless that address confirms it.{% endcall %}
{{ c.paragraph("If that was you, there is nothing to do here. If it was not, change your password now and tell your Quill administrator.") }}
{{ c.small("This email was sent to " ~ email ~ ".") }}
{% endblock body %}
{% block reason %}You are receiving this because this is the email address on a Quill account.{% endblock reason %}

{% block text %}
Hi {{ name }},

Somebody signed in as {{ username }} asked to move this Quill account to {{ new_email }}. Nothing changes unless that address confirms it.

If that was you, there is nothing to do here. If it was not, change your password now and tell your Quill administrator.

This email was sent to {{ email }}.
{% endblock text %}
